WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.800
After release. Born, Not Made, by Ruipeng Wang.
[Low room tone. A few distant drops.]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.800
A photograph of the transparent prototype
resting in a hand.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.400
In the exhibition simulation, two visitors
stand on the far side of a tank.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:21.000
[A motor changes pitch in short passes.]
An arm moves beside an electronic core.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.000
A folded body forms inside the vessel.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:32.200
[Airflow rises.] The arm carries the folded
child through the opening.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:40.200
In a close-up material study, the membrane
expands. The creases grow shallow.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.000
[The motor falls quiet. Water resonates.]

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:47.700
Who stays with the newborn?
